B1ImjBVu67IZv47rfhI.jpg"},{"id":1767632,"name":"Jean-Baptiste Blanc","role":"Fils de Bernard","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z8wUM1plWqo88J9nqdvADjiFADa.jpg"},{"id":3417035,"name":"Zacharie Fauchoux","role":"Augustin (5 ans)"},{"id":3595108,"name":"Michèle Grazioli","role":"Dame âgée bus"},{"id":1856297,"name":"Pier Ewudu","role":"Juan, le coach sportif"},{"id":1356425,"name":"Eric Gallienne","role":"Médecin réveil réa 2013"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Lasciatelo dire!","overview":"Béatrice è a Biarritz con la sua famiglia per celebrare l'uscita del libro in cui racconta dell'incidente del marito Frédéric che le ha cambiato del tutto la vita. Cieco, senza peli sulla lingua, divertente e seducente, Frédéric è diventato imprevedibile in tutto. Sebbene i loro nomi nel libro siano stati cambiati per preservare l'anonimato delle persone citate, il libro si trasforma per Béatrice in una sorta di boomerang quando amici e famigliari si riconoscono nelle situazioni raccontate."},{"language":"en-US","title":"No Filter","overview":"Beatrice celebrates with her family the release of her book: she tells about the accident of her husband Frederic. He became blind and without filter - always so funny and seductive, he is totally unpredictable. But this book, hymn-to-life, will turn into a joyful fist because if Beatrice changed the names, each of his friends seeks to find his character. The book awakens secret jealousies, while the group of friends and family pitch."},{"language":"fr-FR","title":"Chamboultout","overview":"Béatrice célèbre avec les siens la sortie de son livre, dans lequel elle raconte l’accident de son mari qui a bouleversé leur vie. Frédéric a perdu la vue et ne peut s’empêcher de dire tout ce qu’il pense : c’est devenu un homme imprévisible et sans filtre bien que toujours aussi drôle et séduisant. Mais ce livre, véritable hymne-à-la-vie, va déclencher un joyeux pugilat car même si Béatrice a changé les noms, chacun de ses proches cherche à retrouver son personnage. Le groupe d’amis et la famille tanguent… mais certaines tempêtes sont salutaires.","tagline":"Depuis son accident, Frédéric est... sans filtre."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/58JxYx66GYZJhntRURB4BjJOMMx.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ozg2NrBRVXVQknETYmalKt9mFdI.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":574861,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/58JxYx66GYZJhntRURB4BjJOMMx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/58JxYx66GYZJhntRURB4BjJOMMx.jpg","language":"it","width":1333,"height":2000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/58JxYx66GYZJhntRURB4BjJOMMx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/58JxYx66GYZJhntRURB4BjJOMMx.jpg","language":"it","width":1333,"height":2000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hcxXtDP8fAtNApvQNiUW4uHEv5L.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hcxXtDP8fAtNApvQNiUW4uHEv5L.jpg","language":"it","width":1687,"height":2529}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"fr":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fzXjaN6CpJ9qD4nBcGYrfSlOIoH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fzXjaN6CpJ9qD4nBcGYrfSlOIoH.jpg","language":"fr","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fzXjaN6CpJ9qD4nBcGYrfSlOIoH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fzXjaN6CpJ9qD4nBcGYrfSlOIoH.jpg","language":"fr","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6IDrtdpOROu9CFnBY2lLYonlD5X.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6IDrtdpOROu9